title: "fastprep: asymmetric quality-weighted polyX trimming for FASTQ/FASTA reads"
abstract: "Quality-weighted adapter and polyX trimming at 5', 3' and in the interior of reads, with quality filtering, hard trimming, length filtering and optional PCR deduplication, in a single pass."
